# CI enforcement is security-sensitive: a PR can rewrite workflow YAML, and
# GitHub runs the merge-commit copy on pull_request. The Docs Drift job pins
# the check script to the base branch; these owners still have to review
# workflow/script changes so the pin itself cannot be removed unnoticed.
.github/workflows/ @icon-project/frontend-write
.github/scripts/ @icon-project/frontend-write
.github/CODEOWNERS @icon-project/frontend-write
